invariant: INV-7
file: handshake_flight.c
catches: webpki_session_aes
builds: bin/webpki_session_aes
reason: a client whose ch_cfg.cipher_suites left a suite out takes that
  suite back from a ServerHello or a HelloRetryRequest, because the parser
  accepts every suite the build holds. RFC 9846 sections 4.2.3 and 4.2.4
  make a suite the hello did not list an illegal_parameter abort.

--- old
    if (!hs_suite_offered(&h->t->cfg, info->suite) ||
        (!info->hrr && h->suite != 0 && info->suite != h->suite)) {
--- new
    if ((!info->hrr && h->suite != 0 && info->suite != h->suite)) {
